"""{{ domain_title }} bounded context.

Layers, innermost first (``python manage.py check`` enforces the direction):

- ``domain``: the model (aggregates, value objects, events). Pure Python.
- ``application``: use cases that change aggregates through a unit of work.
- ``infrastructure``: the tables, and the unit of work on the database.
- ``api``: the HTTP resources (``docs/resources.md``).

``apps.py`` wires the layers together when the domain is installed.
"""
